cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "insurance-credibility"
abstract: >
  Credibility models for UK non-life insurance pricing. Implements
  Bühlmann-Straub group credibility for scheme and fleet pricing, hierarchical
  Bühlmann-Straub for nested group structures, and individual policy experience
  rating via dynamic Poisson-Gamma state-space models. All models use
  exposure-weighted structural parameter estimation with method of moments.
authors:
  - name: "Burning Cost Contributors"
